- `rg` is NOT installed; use `python3 /tmp/pysearch.py '<regex>' <dir>` for minified single-line JS searches (grep tool fails with "Ripgrep JSON record exceeded 65536 bytes").
- Account A (Ubiquiti SSO) valid:
  - email `uitest1ad6967@maxxspace.com`, username `qacct1a6967`, password `Tx!11703594536aec8d9aA`
  - SSO uuid `314f82e1-8e68-488a-ad94-96e1c252990b`; community lithium id `281f5e1b-9409-4d0d-beb9-56392e9488e3`
  - `UBIC_AUTH` cookie in `result/accounts/accountA-cookies.json`; `https://sso.ui.com/api/sso/v1/user/self` returns 200 (valid until ~Dec 2026)
- Account B unresolved: signup returns `403 CHALLENGE_RECAPTCHA_TOKEN_REQUIRED` and image CAPTCHA; do not bypass anti-abuse.
- Design temp users ARE usable as second identity: anon `GET https://design.svc.ui.com/user/me` creates `isTemp:true`, `role:"nobody"` user and can list/create projects (contradicts earlier inventory note that temp users get 401).
- Redirect validation looks robust (do not re-chase): `MC` checks registrable domain via `hostname.split('.').slice(-2)` against `Rpe` allowlist and `http/https`; `Wpe` requires leading `/`, no `//`, no `\`, allowlisted app paths.
- Community text rendering uses DOMPurify (`vL.sanitize`) with `ALLOWED_TAGS` and `ALLOWED_ATTR:["class","href"]`; video iframe `src` via `Sc` allows only `https://` or `blob:${location.origin}`.
- postMessage handlers reviewed: account checks `e.source===window.parent` + `$he` (https + `MC`); design `CheckoutPage` validates `e.origin` against imported allowlist `m`; no obvious exploit.
- Mass-assignment/privilege lead: design `PATCH /user/:ssoId/role` body `{role}` and `PATCH /user/:ssoId/blocked` body `{block}`; role enum `ln` in `product-DDygbo97.js`: `{NOBODY:"nobody", ADMIN:"admin"}` (exported as `Z`→`h` in `UserListPage-yQc67R1z.js`).
- Community impersonation lead (untested server-side): `publishAs` accepts `"ui-team"` vs self; UI gates via `hasPermission(QuestionMarkAsOfficial)`. Reply create: `POST /api/v1/replies/` body `{id,threadId,type,parentReplyId,publishAs,content}`; GraphQL `createQuestion` also takes `publishAs`.
- Community REST with `UBIC_AUTH`: `/api/v1/users/{community-id}` returns public profile only (no email); nonexistent id → `404 User not found by id`; `/api/v1/notifications/` 200; `/api/v1/feed/personalized` needs `?threadType=QUESTION|RELEASE`; `/api/v1/member-groups/` 403 for user.
- Design API auth: call `/user/me` with `UBIC_AUTH` into cookie jar to receive `ui|design-center|sid`; then `/project` works. Without jar, `/project` returns `401 errors.user.access "User not authenticated"`.

## Work State
### Completed
- Read `skills/AGENT.md`, `skills/client-side-skill.md`, `skills/server-side-skill.md`; reviewed prior `SUMMARY.md`, `scope.md`, `unresolved.md`, inventory, recon, finding report.
