- Enumerated API paths from community/design/account bundles (community REST `/api/v1/*`, design `/project/*`, `/user/*`, `/developer/*`, `/assistant/*`).
- Established design session for Account A in `/tmp/design.jar`; role `nobody`; own project `60b8c381-2101-4dd2-92ed-e032c8a575a6` title `qa-idor-test`.
- Created design temp identity B in `/tmp/designB.jar`: ssoId `e91d81b6-9a8e-4ddb-b6f7-fe103f486629`, project `5b642ccb-6e73-458c-b8cf-a6e9b2437350` title `anon-test`.
