### Active
- Investigating design role escalation via `PATCH https://design.svc.ui.com/user/314f82e1-8e68-488a-ad94-96e1c252990b/role` with body `{"role":"admin"}` using `/tmp/design.jar` + `UBIC_AUTH`; plan to verify persistence via `/user/me`, then revert to `nobody`.
- Considering community `publishAs:"ui-team"` server-enforcement test (would require creating post on a test-owned thread, then deleting).

### Blocked
- Second full SSO account (Account B) blocked by interactive reCAPTCHA image challenge.
- Design temp users blocked from `duplicate` and presumably admin actions.
- No second real-user project ID available for cross-user IDOR beyond agent-created objects.

## Next Move
